* Task 2 fixture: SELECT loop with FROM table and INTO targets
* Demonstrates FR-19 requirement: native SQL SELECT...FROM reads DDM once
* See also: fixture 10-sql-select-loop.nsp in parser tests
* Expected: one EdgeReads entry for SQL-PERSONNEL (the FROM table operand)
* and zero edges for the column names or INTO target variables

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #NAME (A30)
  1 #SALARY (N9.2)
  1 #PERS-ID (N5)
END-DEFINE

SELECT COL1, COL2 INTO #NAME, #SALARY FROM SQL-PERSONNEL WHERE DEPT = :#PERS-ID
  CALLNAT 'PROCESS'
END-SELECT

END
